{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/637791-do-wraiths-poop","id":637791,"title":"Do Wraiths Poop?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-24T02:38:57-07:00","id":637791,"title":"Do Wraiths Poop?","content":"I know they can't eat if they are risen but...Do wraiths poop? Do they have souls harvested from the reapers or whatever they are called and then soul forged into wraith food which they then poop?<br /> <br /> Can I be a newborn wraith sold into the soul forged and be made into Wraith Toilet paper letting out screams as I am rolled little by little over long periods of time &quot; as I don't see wraiths eating wraith food a normal thing&quot; and the wraith using me as screaming spectral face popping out of the tissue toilet paper like that bob marley scene from a christmas carol?<br /> <br /> Is the toilet also made from the souls of long dead orphan babies or black people?<br /> <br /> DO WRAITHS POOP!? Please say they do!<br /> I can imagine a whole economy of wraith food vendors selling food forged out of the souls of children. <br /> Soul Scream Cones! - East Texas flavored ( made from the souls of those who came from east Texas ) <br /> Shiskasouls - Meat looking soul bobs grilled on the same kinda fires the soul forge has. <br /> <br /> Oh..and the soul toilet paper can have the names of those soul forged into it written on them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7409,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7409-veil","user":"veil","date":". 08-24-2015, 07:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7409-veil","name":"veil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"da