:[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T07:27:55-07:00","id":638005,"title":"","content":"Did anyone else picture Monkey D Luffy from One Piece asking this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T07:31:54-07:00","id":638008,"title":"","content":"No. Wraiths don't eat and they don't poop.<br /> <br /> But in your games, with the Golden Rule, YMMV.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T13:09:57-07:00","id":638293,"title":"","content":"This is one of those strange, intangible areas of Wraith, because we don't actually know.<br /> <br /> On the one hand, yes Wraiths are just plasmic things, they don't have bodies let alone the functions that bodies entail. They sustain themselves on emotion and anchor themselves with meaning. There's no leftover or residue, only pathos and angst.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, they are defined by memories; it's really all they are. Memories define how they look, what they want, and most importantly, how they act. If self image can determine what they look like, expectation should also determine what hungers and desires they think they are going to have and how they react to those desires. Perhaps with experience Wraiths forget what it is to be bound to the demands of flesh, but in their younger years Wraiths could plausibly feel hunger and quite possibly its counterpart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T14:20:50-07:00","id":638347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>veil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/637791-do-wraiths-poop#post637791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know they can't eat if they are risen but...Do wraiths poop? Do they have souls harvested from the reapers or whatever they are called and then soul forged into wraith food which they then poop?<br /> <br /> Can I be a newborn wraith sold into the soul forged and be made into Wraith Toilet paper letting out screams as I am rolled little by little over long periods of time &quot; as I don't see wraiths eating wraith food a normal thing&quot; and the wraith using me as screaming spectral face popping out of the tissue toilet paper like that bob marley scene from a christmas carol?<br /> <br /> Is the toilet also made from the souls of long dead orphan babies or black people?<br /> <br /> DO WRAITHS POOP!? Please say they do!<br /> I can imagine a whole economy of wraith food vendors selling food forged out of the souls of children.<br /> Soul Scream Cones! - East Texas flavored ( made from the souls of those who came from east Texas )<br /> Shiskasouls - Meat looking soul bobs grilled on the same kinda fires the soul forge has.<br /> <br /> Oh..and the soul toilet paper can have the names of those soul forged into it written on them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gurl.<br /> <br /> <i>Gurl.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Gurl.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> You have *got* to get yourself together...<br /> <br /> <br /> ... get the doctor to up your meds....<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T15:37:49-07:00","id":638415,"title":"","content":"Short answer? <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:72px\"><b>NO.</b></span></div> <br /> Longer answer? <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:72px\"><b>NOOOOOOOOOOOOOO.</b></span></div> <br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T20:55:01-07:00","id":661434,"title":"","content":"Probably not, but the mighty have ways to force the experience upon a wraith. You do not want to anger those who can curse you to excrete forever. This fits perfectly into most versions of hell I have read about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>there are no bad ideas, just ideas that have not been refined enough","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1608-iamthesweeper","name":"IAmTheSweeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T23:23:30-07:00","id":661577,"title":"","content":"This question sort of reminds me of a little something I came across a while ago.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.goblinscomic.org/01202007/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.goblinscomic.org/images/logo-2025.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.goblinscomic.org/01202007/\" target=\"_blank\"> Goblins - </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.goblinscomic.org/01202007/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.goblinscomic.org/01202007/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Goblins is the story of a fantasy rpg through the eyes of the low-level monsters. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T04:41:04-07:00","id":661785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>veil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/637791-do-wraiths-poop#post637791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know they can't eat if they are risen but...Do wraiths poop? Do they have souls harvested from the reapers or whatever they are called and then soul forged into wraith food which they then poop?<br /> <br /> Can I be a newborn wraith sold into the soul forged and be made into Wraith Toilet paper letting out screams as I am rolled little by little over long periods of time &quot; as I don't see wraiths eating wraith food a normal thing&quot; and the wraith using me as screaming spectral face popping out of the tissue toilet paper like that bob marley scene from a christmas carol?<br /> <br /> Is the toilet also made from the souls of long dead orphan babies or black people?<br /> <br /> DO WRAITHS POOP!? Please say they do!<br /> I can imagine a whole economy of wraith food vendors selling food forged out of the souls of children.<br /> Soul Scream Cones! - East Texas flavored ( made from the souls of those who came from east Texas )<br /> Shiskasouls - Meat looking soul bobs grilled on the same kinda fires the soul forge has.<br /> <br /> Oh..and the soul toilet paper can have the names of those soul forged into it written on them.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're thinking of <b>Kindred of the East</b>. The ruling Yama King of each Hell (out of the Thousand Hells of Yomi) are virtually omnipotent in their own realm, and get to set whatever rules they want. And most of them go for &quot;psychotically deranged&quot;. Being used as toilet paper was even explicitly mentioned in the corebook. <br /> <br /> The poor bastards weren't soulforged (or Moliated), though. Doing so would spoil the fun! (At least in the demons' minds). Instead, a demon would just tear a bunch of skin off one of the damned souls, wipe themselves with it, and toss it into a thorny bush. The author (thankfully) left it up to our imaginations whether a damned soul could automatically regrow that skin, or if they'd someone have to &quot;reclaim&quot; it . . . <br /> <br /> (There's a reason, after all, that the average kuei-jin rises in a particularly vicious form of catharsis - one they often can't break out of on their own)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T18:03:53-07:00","id":665108,"title":"","content":"I vaguely recall reading something about some spectres being made when Malfeans capture and <b>eat</b> wraiths, with the resulting spectres being excreted afterwards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T22:11:41-07:00","id":665390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/637791-do-wraiths-poop?p=661785#post661785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're thinking of <b>Kindred of the East</b>. The ruling Yama King of each Hell (out of the Thousand Hells of Yomi) are virtually omnipotent in their own realm, and get to set whatever rules they want. And most of them go for &quot;psychotically deranged&quot;. Being used as toilet paper was even explicitly mentioned in the corebook.<br /> <br /> The poor bastards weren't soulforged (or Moliated), though. Doing so would spoil the fun! (At least in the demons' minds). Instead, a demon would just tear a bunch of skin off one of the damned souls, wipe themselves with it, and toss it into a thorny bush. The author (thankfully) left it up to our imaginations whether a damned soul could automatically regrow that skin, or if they'd someone have to &quot;reclaim&quot; it . . .<br /> <br /> (There's a reason, after all, that the average kuei-jin rises in a particularly vicious form of catharsis - one they often can't break out of on their own)</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, while in hell, they aren't proper wraiths. It's just the shadow/vigor soul part. The psyche/cloud soul part is still hovering around the body or burial site.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T03:09:51-07:00","id":669367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/637791-do-wraiths-poop?p=665108#post665108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I vaguely recall reading something about some spectres being made when Malfeans capture and <b>eat</b> wraiths, with the resulting spectres being excreted afterwards.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are plenty of references to Malfeans eating other wraiths to gain mass. I can't remember the pooping bit, though, but it does fit some of the more grotesque Malfeans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T09:46:00-07:00","id":669774,"title":"","content":"If it's important enough, I guess wraiths of all stripes would probably have to use Moliate to &quot;poop&quot;, which would mean permanently separating part of their corpus in a manner that fits with the &quot;aesthetic&quot; being explored. <br /> <br /> I guess the &quot;fun&quot; would come in with the elasticity of plasm. If you can turn an entire wraith into a coin, you can probably take that lump and stretch it out into all sorts of things. Sorta like wraith silly-putty, but on steroids.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T14:04:59-07:00","id":670149,"title":"","content":"I'd have to say NO<br /> <br /> Saw a thread on a startrek site on if data pooped or not and rolled my eyes at it...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T00:17:19-07:00","id":670529,"title":"","content":"My guess is that Wraith excretions are basically just a subtle resonance that they give off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T05:48:44-07:00","id":679880,"title":"","content":"Sometimes they do, though its rare. The last thing a wraith crapped out was WoD: Gypsies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1645-autochthon","name":"Autochthon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}